  "story": {
    "day": 1,
    "title": "Kaya's Travel Dreams",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya sat at her brown desk and looked at a map.",
      "She thought about her trip to Canada and America last August.",
      "Next, she remembered the blue boat in Australia in January.",
      "She also visited China in June and saw a black bus.",
      "Then, she wrote about her winter trip to February's cold air.",
      "The test was difficult, but she studied hard until December.",
      "She touched her gray hair and closed her tired eyes.",
      "Kaya opened her mouth and said, \"I love world travel.\"",
      "Finally, she put her bike away and went to her bed.",
      "She dreamed of autumn leaves in the quiet morning air."
    ]
  }
